We have millions of user activities happening in our application.
 We need to basically perform some analytics on top of these activities.

Analytics could include: find the top users in our platform, seggregating users by their region etc.,

Consider an application like Instagram where there are so many users performing so many activities.

Activity
It could be any user operation that is performed in the system.
 Examples of activities include: login, logout, like a post, follow someone, unfollow someone,
 comment on a post, report a comment, report a post, unlike a post etc.,

Context
Our application is a very large and contains a lot of microservices which emits different types of activities.

Requirement
We need to collect all of these activites and perform different analytics on top of these activities.

Priorities
We want to find the top most users in our platform within a given time frame. Definition:
The top most user is the one who has performed most no. of activities within that given timeframe.